# Which gate lanes a changed file selects (scripts/gate.py; the first matching pattern wins, `*`
# matches across directories). Lanes: all, host, bare, or LANE:VARIANT (host:checks, host:all,
# host:default, bare:thumbv7em, bare:riscv32imac). A file no pattern matches: a crate's file selects
# host:all, plus host:default when it holds not(feature) code or builds with a crate that changes
# with a feature (scripts/gate.py builds_differently_by_feature), and bare when a no_std crate reaches
# it; documentation no code or script reads selects host:checks; anything else host:all.
#
# `no-reuse` after the lanes: the file measures or selects (the gate's rules, the lane map, the
# reuse key code, the filter lists, shared test fixtures), so a change to it reuses no crate's
# green run. A line with `no-reuse` and no lanes only marks that; its lanes come from the rules.

# What every lane builds or runs with.
Cargo.toml                  all
Cargo.lock                  all
rust-toolchain.toml         all
.cargo/*                    all
.config/*                   all no-reuse
crates/*/Cargo.toml         all
crates/*/build.rs           all
scripts/gate*               all no-reuse
scripts/affected.py         all no-reuse
scripts/test-layout.py      all no-reuse
scripts/rustdoc-only.sh     all no-reuse
scripts/one-shm.py          all
scripts/cargo-seed.sh       all
scripts/cargo-home.sh       all no-reuse
scripts/seed-bake.sh        host:checks
scripts/seed-list.py        all
scripts/lanes-behind.sh     all
scripts/release-check.sh    all
scripts/land.sh             all
scripts/check.sh            all
scripts/area.sh             host:checks
scripts/ab-target.sh        host:checks
scripts/dstate-sample.sh    host:checks
scripts/key-guard-proof.sh  host:checks
# Test data any crate's tests may read.
data/*                      host:all no-reuse
# Shared test fixtures: the one simulated camera every camera test runs, and the case declarations
# (not_run, dma_case) that decide whether a case runs or is reported as not run.
crates/camera/sim/*         no-reuse
crates/core/frame/src/not_run.rs no-reuse
